# HOOKS.md

Automated guardrails from the agentic-workflow plugin. **Hooks execute from the
installed plugin**, not from this project — do not add a project-local
`.cursor/hooks/hooks.json` expecting it to run.

After bootstrap, `.cursor/hooks/` contains **read-only symlinks** for browsing script
sources and wiring. The active config is always the plugin copy.

| Location | Path |
|---|---|
| Cursor plugin (active) | `~/.cursor/plugins/local/agentic-workflow/hooks/` |
| Claude Code plugin (active) | plugin `hooks/` dir (via `/plugin install`) |
| In-repo (reference) | `.cursor/hooks/` — symlinks only |

## What runs when

| Script | Cursor event | Claude Code event | Effect |
|---|---|---|---|
| `dep-age-guard.sh` | `beforeShellExecution` | `PreToolUse` (Bash) | Blocks `npm`/`pnpm`/`yarn`/`bun`/`pip` installs of packages published <14 days ago |
| `format-changed.sh` | `afterFileEdit` | `PostToolUse` (Edit\|Write) | Best-effort Prettier on the edited file; never fails the turn |
| `run-tests.sh` | `stop` | `Stop` | Runs the project test suite (npm/pnpm/yarn/bun/pytest); must be green before done |

## Wiring (reference)

Cursor (`hooks.json`):

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "hooks": {
    "beforeShellExecution": [ { "command": "./hooks/dep-age-guard.sh" } ],
    "afterFileEdit":        [ { "command": "./hooks/format-changed.sh" } ],
    "stop":                 [ { "command": "./hooks/run-tests.sh" } ]
  }
}
```

Claude Code uses `PreToolUse` / `PostToolUse` / `Stop` with `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/…`
paths — see the plugin's `hooks/hooks.json`.

A symlink to the Cursor wiring is at `.cursor/hooks/hooks.json`.

## Scripts (symlinked)

- `.cursor/hooks/dep-age-guard.sh`
- `.cursor/hooks/format-changed.sh`
- `.cursor/hooks/run-tests.sh`

Override the symlink source with `AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_HOOKS=/path/to/hooks` if needed.
